{"page":88,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"text":"July 27, 1938","y":0.85901162810547427,"conf":1,"w":0.21140143159147984,"x":0.40617577000337779,"h":0.024709302281576417},{"w":0.34916862884125155,"text":"\"Abermal ein Teil vom Fahre,","y":0.8182043646794871,"h":0.01909722222222221,"x":0.29216152444517007,"conf":1},{"x":0.31086512074733164,"w":0.32132131403142761,"y":0.79643515702604994,"h":0.02216892583029606,"text":"abermal ein Tag vollbracht:","conf":1},{"y":0.78050595217921526,"text":"Abermal ein Brett zur Bahre","x":0.31353919660626073,"w":0.32541567319399356,"conf":1,"h":0.017459163590083149},{"h":0.020389211556268161,"text":"und ein Schritt zum Grab gemacht.","conf":1,"x":0.3135392043518429,"y":0.75868055578791349,"w":0.39429927181887936},{"conf":1,"x":0.3135391979084442,"w":0.28028503021636564,"h":0.018895347913106209,"text":"Also nähert sich die Zeit","y":0.73982558195914461},{"x":0.31353919753601989,"text":"nach und nach der Ewigkeit;","conf":1,"y":0.71947674472077239,"w":0.32541567319399345,"h":0.018895347913106209},{"w":0.29928739968832435,"conf":1,"text":"also müssen wir auf Erden","h":0.01744185932098874,"x":0.31353919934823687,"y":0.70058139574648237},{"text":"zum dem Tode reifer werden.\"","conf":1,"x":0.31591449890863055,"y":0.680232558636923,"h":0.020412282338218124,"w":0.34679333575360194},{"x":0.42992874291127919,"w":0.21615201776677911,"h":0.020423818202245814,"conf":1,"text":"J. Chr. Günther","y":0.65988372136302109},{"x":0.29453681988319219,"conf":1,"y":0.61918604678472589,"text":"\"Another season of the year,","w":0.3681710230839717,"h":0.018958794692206071},{"text":"Another day is spent:","w":0.2731591509534167,"h":0.020441122471340112,"conf":1,"y":0.60019841222991521,"x":0.31591448673627665},{"h":0.017609126984126977,"y":0.5813492059531622,"conf":1,"text":"Another board to make the bier,","w":0.41805222746613735,"x":0.31353921111253702},{"h":0.020418050743284732,"y":0.55952380936979229,"x":0.31353920464957175,"w":0.36342041213791099,"conf":1,"text":"Steps to the graveyard bent."},{"w":0.33491684554459217,"conf":1,"text":"As Time draws ever closer","h":0.01744185932098874,"y":0.54360465195287777,"x":0.31591449620038797},{"text":"To touch Eternity,","y":0.52033730195167438,"h":0.020360372369251478,"w":0.23990497341403716,"conf":1,"x":0.31591449853644937},{"conf":1,"text":"For death we should be ripening","y":0.50290697737075563,"w":0.41567695914924913,"h":0.01744185932098874,"x":0.31591449214449646},{"conf":1,"x":0.31591450350360922,"y":0.48401162762477867,"w":0.36579570522556054,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"While this world still we see."},{"h":0.015988372621082214,"conf":1,"w":0.016627077932481638,"text":"I","x":0.50831353953732206,"y":0.4331395344598078},{"y":0.38808139569987599,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.021888842658391083,"text":"IT is very appropriate that the last service of the term should","conf":1,"x":0.11163896112920767},{"h":0.02037767569224036,"w":0.81710211023107748,"y":0.36627907009871707,"text":"be an evening service, for this makes clearer to us the fact","x":0.11163896280098655,"conf":1},{"text":"that our term's work on which we are looking back is","conf":1,"x":0.11140991973016116,"y":0.34211755645782183,"w":0.81766321751978499,"h":0.030927373303307415},{"x":0.1092636675467045,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948865,"text":"immersed in the stream of time which is ever flowing out to","y":0.32118055520551758,"h":0.021842700148385741},{"x":0.11163897447387415,"y":0.2993551582863947,"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107737,"text":"the seas of eternity. These divisions of time which are","h":0.02041228328432354},{"x":0.11163896182824598,"h":0.021923449304368847,"y":0.2760416666478871,"text":"established by the exigencies of our working life and its","conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"conf":1,"text":"organization do not form an architectonic pattern built into","x":0.11163896182824598,"y":0.2543604653714191,"h":0.020441121525234585,"w":0.81710211023107759},{"w":0.81710211023107737,"conf":1,"x":0.11163895842365389,"y":0.23401162840636602,"h":0.01747646691307192,"text":"time as an immovable dimension. It would be truer to think"},{"conf":1,"y":0.2093023261877951,"h":0.020360372369251589,"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.1116389777229409,"text":"of them as swallowed up in the rush of an onward-sweeping"},{"text":"time stream. No doubt it pleases us to look back on the work","x":0.11163895842365389,"y":0.1860119043515257,"w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.020383444097306969,"conf":1},{"text":"accomplished during the term as a piece of work by which","w":0.81491098775492099,"y":0.16256914184904692,"conf":1,"h":0.022116619443136587,"x":0.11393097777006125},{"conf":1,"text":"the building of our life as a whole has been advanced, and","y":0.13953488378127121,"h":0.021923449304368736,"w":0.81472684191418931,"x":0.11401425701202642},{"conf":1,"x":0.11163894996950753,"w":0.81947742808948854,"y":0.11918604690100487,"h":0.01895879469220596,"text":"which will furnish a basis for further building; and with our"},{"conf":1,"h":0.02038921155626805,"y":0.095930232968318374,"w":0.81710211023107759,"x":0.11401427372056563,"text":"plans and projects in mind we like to look forward to the"},{"w":0.047505936065277532,"conf":1,"x":0.49643705568639751,"y":0.065406976589693522,"h":0.024709302281576528,"text":"92"}]}